    "scenesThatPass": [
      "EILEEN: You stay in and mind them kids.\nCATHY: I’m not minding them!\nEILEEN: Oh yes you are.\nEILEEN: Stop your winchin’ and do me hair!",
      "DOLLY: Nothing to worry about there, girls.\nLILY: My nerves are rattling.\nEILEEN: I never won a thing in me life. Except when I got married — I won the sweepstakes then I can tell ya!\nLILY: What’s wrong with ye?",
      "EILEEN: I don’t believe it!\nLILY: Jesus, it’s never Chrissie...\nEILEEN: She’s coming over.\nDOLLY: Who is it?",
      "EILEEN: We all thought she was dead.\nDOLLY: She kept her figure all the same didn’t she?\nEILEEN: I wonder why?\nLILY: Didn’t notice a ring did you?",
      "LILY: Holy Mother of Christ.\nEILEEN: I don't shaggin' believe it!"
    ]
  },
